    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3000
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "色々行楽用品が売られてただろ？\r\nバーベキューセットとか、いいな、と思って眺めてたよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004012010290,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "よかね、バーベキュー！\r\n肉も魚も、外で食べるとうまか～ってなるばい！",
    "charAnim1": "smile4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401201/2004012010290"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004012010300,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "あれ、なんでやろ～？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401201/2004012010300"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "気の置けない仲間が一緒だからってのも\r\n大きいんじゃないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004012010310,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふ～、そうやね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
